The pipeline surface has no descending order (the mapping table: "`order_by` has no descending form"): `.order_by(|r| -r.sum)` is refused (NL0509), `order_by_desc` and `.rev()` have no lowering (NL0505). The tuple `.order_by(|r| (-r.sum, r.acct))` is accepted and silently ordered by the first column ascending instead (finding F5), so the only accepted spelling answers a different query.
